  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transformation and productive support to sheep and alpaca farmers in 3 provinces.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundacin de Organizaciones Campesinas de Salinas (FUNORSAL), $18,144. FUNORSAL will hire a bilingual community organizer to support its expansion into six additional locations. The project is expected to benefit 1,000 families in the provinces of Bolvar, Tungurahua and Chimborazo.</narrative>
